    "body": "Normalize HIGH to 0.76m longest horizontal extent; retain original projecting muzzle, eyes, long arm/elbow/wrist/hand continuity, narrow furry torso, bent legs, foot toes and one native tail. Only supporting soles flattened below 8mm. Native ear rim and temporal UV markings erased, preserving eyes/muzzle.",
