      "ear_l_0": 2148,
      "ear_l_1": 2500,
      "ear_r_0": 3121,
      "ear_r_1": 4976
    },
    "earRootMeasurement": "Actual assembled mesh BVH +X ray exit normal test, independently measured before acceptance; each root has thousands of vertices inside temporal tissue, not floating near it.",
    "rig": "26-bone dedicated primate skeleton: axial chain, two upper/lower/hand chains, two upper/lower/foot chains, four independent ear roots, five tail bones. Geometrically classified segment-distance weights, sole vertices rigid to foot, no unweighted vertices. Hand and curled-tail regions flood through coincident UV-seam vertices; measured tail junction cutoff .50m isolates 1595 vertices. Joint weights smoothed eight passes and all real toe/sole weights restored rigidly to foot bones.",
    "gait": "2.4sec double-support biped slow walk; duty .66, circle radius1m speed .08m/sec, exact inverse circular foot XYZ and yaw baked per frame. Runtime uses matching tangent heading without yaw damping. Special restrained head/arm gesture, returns idle after4sec.",
